     "lib_name":"Device"},
     {"name":"C",
      "lib_name" : "Device"},
     {"name" : "L",
      "lib_name ": "Device"}
  ]
}
```

*(Note: The quotation marks around `VCC` and `GND` are intentional to match the exact symbol names in the KiCad `Device` library.)*<|return|>
